    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m"{% if termsWithAnchors %} id="keeping-information-secure" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>Keep information secure and confidential</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">Information in HMPPS Digital Services is sensitive and must be handled responsibly.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">You must:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>keep prisoner, probation, and staff information confidential</li>
      <li>only share information with people inside or outside HMPPS who are authorised to receive it</li>
      <li>only print, copy, photograph, download or otherwise share information when you have a legitimate work reason and are authorised to do so</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="govuk-body">MOJ employees, contractors, consultants, and temporary staff must follow <a class="govuk-link" href="https://justiceuk.sharepoint.com/sites/SecurityPolicyandGuidance/SitePages/Policy%20and%20Guidance/Asset%20Management/Data-Handling-and-Information-Sharing-Guide.aspx?web=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HMPPS policies when storing, sending or handling information</a></p>
    <p class="govuk-body">You must not:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>allow unauthorised people to view or use HMPPS Digital Services or your staff or work computer</li>
      <li>allow prisoners to view screens, even those that contain their own information</li>
      <li>take screenshots or use web capture tools to take images from HMPPS Digital Services</li>
    </ul>

